        "id": "N002",
        "kind": "internal",
        "statement": "For every natural r, r!·X_M(r)=x_M^r and r!·Y_M(r)=y_M^r in End_Z(M). The inclusion M→V intertwines x_M,y_M,h_M with x,y,h respectively; in particular h preserves M. For all i,j,k,l∈Fin(n), A_ij A_kl=c_j·A_il if j=k, and 0 otherwise. With Dprod=∏_j c_j and d_j=∏_{k≠j}c_k one has d_j c_j=Dprod and ∑_j d_j·A_jj=Dprod·Id_M.",
